# Files that exist in the git repo but must NOT ship to the WordPress.org plugin
# directory or into the GitHub release zip. Single source of truth, used by:
#   - .github/workflows/deploy-wporg.yml (10up action, rsync --exclude-from)
#   - .github/workflows/release.yml      (release zip staging)
# Patterns are rsync exclude syntax; a leading slash anchors to the repo root.
# This list reproduces exactly what the live WordPress.org trunk already omits.
/.git
/.github
/.gitignore
/.gitattributes
/.editorconfig
/.distignore
/.wordpress-org
.DS_Store
/build
/node_modules
/tests
/docs
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/SECURITY.md
/composer.lock
/phpcs.xml.dist
